; SSE2-NEXT:    [[WIDE_LOAD1:%.*]] = load <4 x i32>, ptr [[TMP4]], align 4
; SSE2-NEXT:    [[TMP5:%.*]] = add <4 x i32> [[WIDE_LOAD1]], splat (i32 1)
